        "text": {
            "description_html": "<a name=\"LAU-74577\"><b>Laurey 74577, Transitional Square Cabinet Knob in Venetian Bronze</b></a>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWith an eye-catching design, the Transitional Square Cabinet Knob in Venetian Bronze will be sure to add personality to your kitchen. This Venetian Bronze Square Cabinet Knob is from Laurey, a innovator in cabinet hardware. Each kitchen cabinet knob comes packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis cabinet knob is part of the <a href=\"//search?type=product&q=Laurey+Aventura\">Laurey Aventura Collection</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Laurey 74577 Venetian Bronze Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Venetian Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with 1\" long #8-32 screw and 1-1/2\" long #8-32 screw.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 5 finishes:</b>\r\n<table width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" align=\"center\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"#LAU-74577\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74577-SM.jpg?v=1704354547\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" alt=\"LAU-74577\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/oil-rubbed-bronze-square-cabinet-knob-laurey-74566\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74566-SM.jpg?v=1704354547\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" alt=\"LAU-74566\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/polished-chrome-square-cabinet-knob-laurey-74526\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74526-SM.jpg?v=1704354547\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" alt=\"LAU-74526\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/products/satin-nickel-square-cabinet-knob-laurey-74528\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/LAU-74528-SM.jpg?v=1704354547\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" alt=\"LAU-74528\"></a>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<a href=\"/produ